OL,3,GNEWSALandmark Sea Terminal's crow's
OL,4,Anest set for revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouglas's sea terminal's crow's nest
OL,7,Ftower looks set to be refurbished.
OL,9,FThe existing decorative wall panels
OL,10,Fwill be replaced with a modern rain
OL,11,Fscreen system.
OL,13,FThe Sea Terminal was officially opened
OL,14,Fon 6 July 1965 by Princess Margaret.
OL,16,FIt was designed by the Manx
OL,17,Farchitectural firm Davidson Marsh, with
OL,18,FRon Evans as job architect, and is
OL,19,Fconsidered one of the Island's few
OL,20,Fsignificant examples of Modernist
OL,21,Fconcrete architecture.
